 {{field-1}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, since ${v}_{1}+{v}_{2}=0,$ we have that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9{v}_{1}+4{v}_{2} & =4{v}_{1}+5{v}_{1}+4{v}_{2} \\\\  & =4({v}_{1}+{v}_{2})+5{v}_{1} \\\\  & =4(0)+5{v}_{1} \\\\  & =5{v}_{1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nT(9{v}_{1}+4{v}_{2})=T(5{v}_{1}).\n$$\n\nNow, since $T$ is a linear transformation, we have that $T(kv)=kT(v).$ So \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}T(5{v}_{1}) & =5T({v}_{1}) \\\\  & =5[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}15 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 25\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn conclusion, $T(9{v}_{1}+4{v}_{2})=[\\begin{aligned}15 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 25\\end{aligned}].$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186262618 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9fbd335c-28cc-5f02-b773-f685e8b15417" :knowledge-point/title "Determining the Image of a Vector Sum Under a Map Using Vector Addition and Scalar Multiplication"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6316fc78-fd06-5292-a6bf-05dfdac423ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262620}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6316fc78-fd06-5292-a6bf-05dfdac423ea" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262620} :answer-field/id #uuid "fdc7968b-078a-5b80-b21b-d9d239382b90" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262619} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e2f9d36-6ffb-5fd1-a399-c9b8aa52cd3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262622}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e2f9d36-6ffb-5fd1-a399-c9b8aa52cd3c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186262622} :answer-field/id #uuid "22463d5d-adbc-549c-acd3-355ff79c3355" :answer-fi